# Synced from the invesdwin-maven-plugin .settings/scm_ignore template (single
# source of truth for generated projects). Per-developer, not project content;
# several of these hold machine-specific paths or credentials, so they are
# ignored deliberately. Patterns are unanchored, so they also match inside
# nested module projects.
